From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:29:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: pci: apple,t8010-pcie: Add the J120

The J120 names its own controller ahead of the T8011's, as the J172
does: its NVMe host keeps the namespace write limits of the J120's
bring-up (nvme-apple).

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,t8010-pcie.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,t8010-pcie.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,t8010-pcie.yaml
index cb43a5307..9865daa8d 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,t8010-pcie.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,t8010-pcie.yaml
@@ -250,6 +250,9 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - const: apple,j172-pcie
           - const: apple,t8010-pcie
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,j120-pcie
+          - const: apple,t8011-pcie
 
   reg:
     minItems: 4
